<title>FRANCE: Soccer-Leading French league scorers.</title>
<headline>Soccer-Leading French league scorers.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading scorers in the French first division after Saturday's matches:</p>
<p>10 - Stephane Guivarc'h (Rennes)</p>
<p>9 - David Zitelli (Strasbourg)</p>
<p>8 - Mihalin Becanovic (Lille), Anton Drobnjak (Bastia)</p>
<p>7 - Alain Caveglia (Lyon), Sonny Anderson (Monaco), Japhet N'Doram (Nantes), Leonardo (Paris SG)</p>
<p>5 - Christopher Wreh (Guingamp), Viktor Ikpeba (Monaco)</p>
<p>4 - Lubomir Moravcik (Bastia), Didier Tholot (Bordeaux), Jean-Pierre Papin (Bordeaux), Etienne Mendy (Caen), Mohammed Chaouch (Nice), Xavier Gravelaine (Marseille), James Debbah (Nice).</p>
</text>
